{"title":"Where did my data come from?","sub":"One load, falling through the memory hierarchy until it is found.","kind":"grid","interval":2000,"grid":{"colLabels":["level","size","latency","if L1 = 1 second"]},"legend":[["b","checking now"],["muted","missed"]],"frames":[{"caption":"The CPU wants one value from memory. It checks the fastest, smallest storage first and works down. Latencies are typical; the last column rescales them so that an L1 hit takes one second.","cells":[["L1 cache","","",""],["L2 cache","","",""],["L3 cache","","",""],["DRAM","","",""],["NVMe SSD","","",""],["Hard disk","","",""]],"cellCls":{},"stats":[["Time spent","0"]]},{"caption":"Found in L1 most of the time (well over 90% of loads in typical code): about 4 cycles.","cells":[["L1 cache","48 KB","1 ns","1 second"],["L2 cache","","",""],["L3 cache","","",""],["DRAM","","",""],["NVMe SSD","","",""],["Hard disk","","",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"b","0,1":"b","0,2":"b","0,3":"b"},"stats":[["Time spent","1 ns"],["At human scale","1 second"]]},{"caption":"L1 missed. L2 is bigger and a few times slower.","cells":[["L1 cache","48 KB","1 ns","1 second"],["L2 cache","1-2 MB","4 ns","4 seconds"],["L3 cache","","",""],["DRAM","","",""],["NVMe SSD","","",""],["Hard disk","","",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"muted","0,1":"muted","0,2":"muted","0,3":"muted","1,0":"b","1,1":"b","1,2":"b","1,3":"b"},"stats":[["Time spent","4 ns"],["At human scale","4 seconds"]]},{"caption":"L3 is shared by all cores, bigger again, slower again.","cells":[["L1 cache","48 KB","1 ns","1 second"],["L2 cache","1-2 MB","4 ns","4 seconds"],["L3 cache","32 MB","12 ns","12 seconds"],["DRAM","","",""],["NVMe SSD","","",""],["Hard disk","","",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"muted","0,1":"muted","0,2":"muted","0,3":"muted","1,0":"muted","1,1":"muted","1,2":"muted","1,3":"muted","2,0":"b","2,1":"b","2,2":"b","2,3":"b"},"stats":[["Time spent","12 ns"],["At human scale","12 seconds"]]},{"caption":"DRAM: a trip off the chip. At human scale, over a minute, during which the CPU could have run hundreds of instructions.","cells":[["L1 cache","48 KB","1 ns","1 second"],["L2 cache","1-2 MB","4 ns","4 seconds"],["L3 cache","32 MB","12 ns","12 seconds"],["DRAM","32 GB","80 ns","80 seconds"],["NVMe SSD","","",""],["Hard disk","","",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"muted","0,1":"muted","0,2":"muted","0,3":"muted","1,0":"muted","1,1":"muted","1,2":"muted","1,3":"muted","2,0":"muted","2,1":"muted","2,2":"muted","2,3":"muted","3,0":"b","3,1":"b","3,2":"b","3,3":"b"},"stats":[["Time spent","80 ns"],["At human scale","80 seconds"]]},{"caption":"Not in RAM at all (a page fault): the operating system fetches it from the SSD. At human scale, nearly a day.","cells":[["L1 cache","48 KB","1 ns","1 second"],["L2 cache","1-2 MB","4 ns","4 seconds"],["L3 cache","32 MB","12 ns","12 seconds"],["DRAM","32 GB","80 ns","80 seconds"],["NVMe SSD","2 TB","80 µs","22 hours"],["Hard disk","","",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"muted","0,1":"muted","0,2":"muted","0,3":"muted","1,0":"muted","1,1":"muted","1,2":"muted","1,3":"muted","2,0":"muted","2,1":"muted","2,2":"muted","2,3":"muted","3,0":"muted","3,1":"muted","3,2":"muted","3,3":"muted","4,0":"b","4,1":"b","4,2":"b","4,3":"b"},"stats":[["Time spent","80 µs"],["At human scale","22 hours"]]},{"caption":"On a spinning disk the head has to physically move: about two months at human scale.","cells":[["L1 cache","48 KB","1 ns","1 second"],["L2 cache","1-2 MB","4 ns","4 seconds"],["L3 cache","32 MB","12 ns","12 seconds"],["DRAM","32 GB","80 ns","80 seconds"],["NVMe SSD","2 TB","80 µs","22 hours"],["Hard disk","8 TB","5 ms","58 days"]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"muted","0,1":"muted","0,2":"muted","0,3":"muted","1,0":"muted","1,1":"muted","1,2":"muted","1,3":"muted","2,0":"muted","2,1":"muted","2,2":"muted","2,3":"muted","3,0":"muted","3,1":"muted","3,2":"muted","3,3":"muted","4,0":"muted","4,1":"muted","4,2":"muted","4,3":"muted","5,0":"b","5,1":"b","5,2":"b","5,3":"b"},"stats":[["Time spent","5 ms"],["At human scale","58 days"]]},{"caption":"Six levels spanning a factor of five million in speed. This is why caches work hard to guess what you'll need next, and why code that walks memory in order (good locality) can be 10-100× faster than code that jumps around.","cells":[["L1 cache","48 KB","1 ns","1 second"],["L2 cache","1-2 MB","4 ns","4 seconds"],["L3 cache","32 MB","12 ns","12 seconds"],["DRAM","32 GB","80 ns","80 seconds"],["NVMe SSD","2 TB","80 µs","22 hours"],["Hard disk","8 TB","5 ms","58 days"]],"cellCls":{"0,3":"good","5,3":"bad"},"stats":[["L1 → disk","5,000,000×"]]}]}